---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Delete your PaddleToday account | Paddle Today" description="Delete a PaddleToday account and its synced personal data.">
  <section class="info-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Account</p>
    <h1>Delete your account</h1>
    <p class="muted">Sign in on the <a href="/account/">PaddleToday account page</a> or in the mobile app under More → Account &amp; backup, then choose Delete account. We ask you to verify your sign-in again before deletion.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="info-panel">
    <h2>Cannot open the app?</h2>
    <p class="muted">Email <a href="mailto:hello@paddletoday.com?subject=PaddleToday%20account%20deletion%20request">hello@paddletoday.com</a> from the email address on your account. Ask us to delete your PaddleToday account and synced personal data. We will verify account ownership before processing the request.</p>
    <p class="muted">Please do not send passwords, sign-in links, or provider security codes. Deletion removes your account, synced saved routes and notes, trips you own, your personal paddle logs and photos, and your memberships in other trips. Trips owned by someone else remain for their organizer and other paddlers. Any restricted recovery copies follow the hosting provider's retention schedule. Existing email or push alerts are managed separately through their existing unsubscribe controls.</p>
    <p><a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
